        "essence_text": "A breathtakingly audacious and emotionally overwhelming journey through infinite realities that somehow never loses its beating heart. The film weaponizes pure absurdity—from talking rocks to googly-eyed universes—serving as a vehicle for surprisingly profound meditations on family, regret, and unconditional love. Every frame crackles with kinetic, inventive energy, yet the emotional core remains grounded in a deeply human immigrant mother-daughter story. It is a wildly inventive, chaotic, and ultimately cathartic cinematic experience that leaves viewers laughing, weeping, and quietly reconsidering their own lives."
